# Contributor Covenant Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge

We pledge to make participation in our community a welcoming, inclusive, and harassment-free experience for everyone.

## Our Standards

Positive behavior includes respect, empathy, constructive feedback, and kindness. Unacceptable behavior includes harassment, insults, personal attacks, and sharing private information without permission.

## Enforcement Responsibilities

Community leaders are responsible for clarifying and enforcing the standards of this Code of Conduct and taking appropriate corrective action.

## Scope

This Code of Conduct applies in all community spaces and when individuals officially represent the community in public spaces.

## Enforcement

Unacceptable behavior may be reported to community leaders. Reports will be reviewed and investigated promptly and fairly, with respect for privacy.

## Enforcement Guidelines

Community leaders may issue a correction, warning, temporary ban, or permanent ban depending on the severity and pattern of the violation.

